   "en": "A frog saw a big ox.",
   "p": 0
  },
  {
   "ar": "بده يصير كبير مثله.",
   "en": "He wanted to become big like him.",
   "p": 0
  },
  {
   "ar": "نفخ حاله شوي.",
   "en": "He puffed himself up a little.",
   "p": 1
  },
  {
   "ar": "سأل أولاده: صرت مثله؟",
   "en": "He asked his children: have I become like him?",
   "p": 1
  },
  {
   "ar": "قالوا: لسا لأ.",
   "en": "They said: not yet.",
   "p": 1
  },
  {
   "ar": "نفخ أكتر وأكتر وانفجر.",
   "en": "He puffed more and more and burst.",
   "p": 2
